%% Status: target (migration step 4, ADR-0006). model/ side is written; shared/species and the
%% Android LiteRT runner are not built yet. iOS is integrated first, Android next.
sequenceDiagram
    participant F as shared session
    participant P as shared preprocessing
    participant M as ImageModel port
    participant R as Android LiteRT runner<br/>(androidApp/platform)
    participant SP as shared species

    Note over F: after the quality check accepts the photo
    F->>P: accepted PixelImage
    P->>P: centre square crop, bilinear resize to 224 px<br/>quantize: q = v / scale + zeroPoint (from traits-vN.json)
    P->>M: run(PixelImage 224x224)
    M->>R: implemented natively
    R->>R: load traits-vN.tflite once<br/>set uint8 input, invoke
    R-->>M: Map("species" -> FloatArray logits)
    M-->>SP: logits
    SP->>SP: softmax(logits / temperature)
    alt P(sorghum) >= sorghumThreshold
        SP-->>F: continue to calibration and traits
    else top class is a named look-alike and confident
        SP-->>F: NotSorghum(name, e.g. "maize", "Johnson grass")
    else below threshold
        SP-->>F: Unsure: retake or try another photo type
    end
